1261
01:42:45.624 --> 01:42:59.121
《Жоқ, жасама!》

1262
01:42:59.121 --> 01:43:00.621
Hin Hin!

1263
01:43:01.673 --> 01:43:06.673
Hin! Hin hin hin!

1264
01:43:12.117 --> 01:43:15.120
Moving... Is Howl alive?

1265
01:43:15.120 --> 01:43:17.120
Tell me where Howl is!

1266
01:43:21.110 --> 01:43:22.610
Ах!

1267
01:43:36.625 --> 01:43:38.127
Хин!

1268
01:43:38.127 --> 01:43:40.627
Castle door….

1269
01:43:46.135 --> 01:44:05.637
